; Direct C emission from the structured SSA IR: no Loop IR in between. It reuses
; the C runtime text and failure-record ABI of [loop_ir] (one definition of the
; record a host decodes) and nothing of its program or its emitter. Pure text,
; no process API: the compiler and the host are [loop_c_exec]'s.

(library
 (name ssa_c)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt loop_ir ssa_ir))
